{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become Katana</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A swords-woman and sorceress blessed by the Lightning Lynx.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/Gif12.gif?t=1749639536\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Let instinct be your guide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey of slaughter through a world packed with bloodthirsty inhabitants driven mad under the Eternal Sun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/Explore_OPen_worlds.png?t=1749639536\" />Explore the Empress\u2019 Domain </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where both nature and architecture grew to rival the ancient titans the size. Brave through portals to new worlds: from an icy and savage tundra, to a scorching desert where time stands still. Finding a hidden pathway could send you either to a secluded paradise in the ocean\u2019s embrace, or trap you in an abyss of blood and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/Dynamic_Combat_System.png?t=1749639536\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Easy to play endless to master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parry and counter, flip and shoot, explode, bomb, or call lightning and meteors upon your opponents with numerous combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every attack may be withdrawn into another at any given time, and timing your attacks and blocks with the enemies' impact will automatically preform spectacle counters instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/GIF9.gif?t=1749639536\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kill the Seven Sages, Become the Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find hidden bosses and overcome their unique challenges to gain mastery of their magical element and fighting style.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694580?t=1749639536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3694580?t=1749639536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/c44fca09e3059d7e46d4929752bf63229c1fa57e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749639536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/c44fca09e3059d7e46d4929752bf63229c1fa57e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749639536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,4,5],"notes":"Contains depictions of violence and revealing outfits."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Become Katana</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A swords-woman and sorceress blessed by the Lightning Lynx.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/Gif12.gif?t=1749639536\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Let instinct be your guide</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a journey of slaughter through a world packed with bloodthirsty inhabitants driven mad under the Eternal Sun.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/Explore_OPen_worlds.png?t=1749639536\" />Explore the Empress\u2019 Domain </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where both nature and architecture grew to rival the ancient titans the size. Brave through portals to new worlds: from an icy and savage tundra, to a scorching desert where time stands still. Finding a hidden pathway could send you either to a secluded paradise in the ocean\u2019s embrace, or trap you in an abyss of blood and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/Dynamic_Combat_System.png?t=1749639536\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Easy to play endless to master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parry and counter, flip and shoot, explode, bomb, or call lightning and meteors upon your opponents with numerous combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every attack may be withdrawn into another at any given time, and timing your attacks and blocks with the enemies' impact will automatically preform spectacle counters instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/extras/GIF9.gif?t=1749639536\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kill the Seven Sages, Become the Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find hidden bosses and overcome their unique challenges to gain mastery of their magical element and fighting style.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Pure Instinct Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694580/13ad84363aac73c152e5eae844190dff2e4eb49f/header.jpg?t=1749639536","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257147082,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147082/movie480.mp4?t=1749233567","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257147082/movie_max.mp4?t=17492335